 (private servers);</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Milestone 2 (Demo Available)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next milestone is to pivot the static level design toward procedural format featuring  endless procedurally-generated levels. Every game you play will be unique. There will not be an end to the levels, until you lose to difficulty scaling that is.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally-generated level (Endless mode);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More in-depth end-game content, such as more ways to upgrade your weapons, skills;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535400/extras/d65bf1bfffeb4e068e011999462ddb92.avif?t=1755022219\" width=818 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Milestone 3</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535400/extras/08b13ba8688773790b79a530fa7b795f.poster.avif?t=1755022219\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535400/extras/08b13ba8688773790b79a530fa7b795f.webm?t=1755022219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535400/extras/08b13ba8688773790b79a530fa7b795f.mp4?t=1755022219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535400/extras/a14ce058a7cf36d0bb1046079cc6dadf.poster.avif?t=1755022219\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535400/extras/a14ce058a7cf36d0bb1046079cc6dadf.webm?t=1755022219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535400/extras/a14ce058a7cf36d0bb1046079cc6dadf.mp4?t=1755022219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As network features can be resource-intensive, common industry multiplayer features will be postponed until this milestone. By the time this milestone will be completed, you can play with people without having to host a server yourself.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature-complete game with multiple dungeon types;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboard;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official dedicated server;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer support including client hosting, online match-making;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot-join (Joining in the middle of the game);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Account system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For coop, the maximum capacity per server instance is <strong>8</strong>;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended maximum resolution:\u00a0<strong>1920 x 1080</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements are disabled for demo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have feedback about the game, feel free to leave a comment in the discussion section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like the demo and would like to support the project? Wishlist it so to get notified when the full game releases!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
